    "body": "```suggestion\n.2+| 66-75   .2+| *Reserved*                          .2+| -       |                   .2+| Reserved for Y base ISA\n```\n\n(check the whitespace though...)\n\n* Assigning them names encourages tools to start decoding them as such, which we don't want (c.f. https://github.com/riscv-non-isa/riscv-elf-psabi-doc/blob/master/introduction.adoc#status-of-abi)\n* Not all of them will be dynamic\n* (RISC-V is redundant and \"base ISA\" reads better to me)",
